<title>INDIA: India IDBI closes on tap issue of Omni bonds.</title>
<headline>India IDBI closes on tap issue of Omni bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading term-lender Industrial development Bank of India (IDBI) has closed its on-tap issue of Omni Bonds, money market dealers said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue has received good response and was closed today,&quot; said a dealer.</p>
<p>The Omni bonds, with a 13.5 percent coupon payable half-yearly, opened for subscription towards the end of May, he said.</p>
<p>IDBI officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
